### FaceForensics++ sample videos

The two videos analysed (`000.mp4`, `000_003.mp4`) ship with the upstream
repository and originate from FaceForensics++, governed by the FaceForensics++
Terms of Use. They are **not** redistributed here; `.gitignore` excludes
`resources/`.

Two single frames are included under `xai/audit/` solely as evidence for the
ground-truth label verification documented in the README.

### OpenAI CLIP

